  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 pound) beef brisket, trimmed of fat",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "1 medium onion, thinly sliced",
    "1 (12 fluid ounce) can beer",
    "1 (12 ounce) bottle tomato-based chili sauce",
    "0.75 cup packed brown sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LlcRfWQ1OOk7J_4S5HPYT1-zTN4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_57264_SimplytheEasiestBeefBrisket_Shot1_11884-042360101bdb462ebe3b522206758998.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57264/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Season brisket on all sides with salt and pepper and place in a glass baking dish. Cover with a layer of sliced onion.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VjMLfRfIO_7hOYVssPe4opxcasA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_57264_SimplytheEasiestBeefBrisket_Shot2_11890-e33aef17a11747488687869bb5cd6155.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57264/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix beer, chili sauce, and brown sugar together in a medium bowl. Pour over beef brisket. Cover the dish tightly with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CjYGJiCBhgWS6Z0KXpLe0xxKmPM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_57264_SimplytheEasiestBeefBrisket_Shot3_11893-95ac28cfb520428993dea21cc4c4b1e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57264/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 3 hours. Remove the aluminum foil and bake for an additional 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Lu-DpxaMkaV4ieDswBFGitdFUtY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_57264_SimplytheEasiestBeefBrisket_Shot4_12071-273ed3d26bb74ff488e1672a92d0fee4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/57264/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let brisket rest and cool slightly before slicing and returning to the dish. Reheat in the oven with the sauce spooned over the sliced meat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/to5pdxKwcxPMJLRzxLlusam9oI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_57264_SimplytheEasiestBeefBrisket_4x3_Shot5_12098-8228b7ac6d204529abaab471ea044ef9.jpg"
